     "explanation": "Seneca's own consolation letters model the authentic sequence: name the loss honestly, then offer perspective. Toxic positivity, as Ehrenreich documented in cancer culture, skips the acknowledgment step entirely and can shame people for expressing legitimate pain -- which is a corruption of Stoic method, not an application of it.",
